  "markdown": "The Wallcovering Guide · Choose and source\n\n# House of Hackney\n\nHouse of Hackney designs nature-inspired wallpapers and interior collections. Its wallcovering materials include paper and cork, with composition and origin checked for each design. The official website offers wallpaper and samples alongside showroom consultations.\n\n## Source evidence\n\nRead the maker’s information for the selected product and destination. A brand profile does not certify a seller or prove that an order will be accepted.\n\n- [Official source: houseofhackney.com/en-intl/pages/our-story](https://www.houseofhackney.com/en-intl/pages/our-story) — checked 17 October 2026\n- [Official source: houseofhackney.com/pages/our-materials](https://www.houseofhackney.com/pages/our-materials) — checked 17 October 2026\n- [Official source: houseofhackney.com/products/troop-wallpaper-birch](https://www.houseofhackney.com/products/troop-wallpaper-birch) — checked 17 October 2026\n\n[Visit maker website](https://www.houseofhackney.com/)\n\n## Official sourcing routes\n\nCheck the route’s scope before ordering. Showrooms, samples and finder links do not establish a roll checkout or delivery promise.\n\n### Shop or product ordering\n\nSelect wallpaper and order it or a sample through the official product page.\n\n**Region**\n: UK; international delivery described\n\n**UK access**\n: UK delivery is expressly described, rather than inferred from currency or cart.\n\n**Overseas access**\n: International delivery section states duties-paid treatment; country eligibility still needs checking.\n\nMaker-published information; confirm current eligibility and destination before ordering.\n\nTerms and checks before ordering\n\nPaid sample ordering shown; trade pricing requires login, with application offered. Page states printed-to-order wallpaper cannot be returned or cancelled. Delivery cost confirmed at checkout.\n\nChecked on the official website on 17 October 2026. This check did not include placing an order.\n\n[Open official source: Shop or product ordering, UK; international delivery described](https://www.houseofhackney.com/products/troop-wallpaper-birch)\n\n### Showroom or brand contact\n\nUse the official story page's showroom links to plan a visit or consultation.\n\n**Region**\n: London, UK; New York, US\n\n**UK access**\n: London flagship and store provide an evidenced UK physical enquiry route.\n\n**Overseas access**\n: New York showroom is separately evidenced; it does not prove shipment to other countries.\n\nMaker-published information; confirm current eligibility and destination before ordering.\n\nTerms and checks before ordering\n\nOfficial story says both London and New York showrooms are open to the public and offer complimentary design consultations. Confirm visit arrangements using the current showroom page; sample and order terms are separate.\n\nChecked on the official website on 17 October 2026. This check did not include placing an order.\n\n[Open official source: Showroom or brand contact, London, UK; New York, US](https://www.houseofhackney.com/en-intl/pages/our-story)\n\n[All makers](https://www.mrwallcover.com/makers/)\n\n## From sample to specification\n\nRecord the exact design and product code, check current instructions and establish the wall preparation before quantities and installation are agreed.\n\n[Discuss your wallcovering](https://www.mrwallcover.com/contact/?intent=source)\n\nBy [Dorin Burcus](https://www.mrwallcover.com/about/#dorin), founder · Last updated 18 October 2026\n",
